WEBVTT

00:03:59.235 --> 00:04:02.196
"I'm not goofing off
or looking at Facebook,

00:04:02.238 --> 00:04:03.489
which I was."

00:04:04.407 --> 00:04:06.158
But people have adapted

00:04:06.200 --> 00:04:10.413
and they prefer getting their downtime
as a whole day off

00:04:10.454 --> 00:04:12.415
rather than in snippets.

00:04:14.041 --> 00:04:16.919
Government initiatives
have similar findings.

00:04:16.961 --> 00:04:19.255
In 2015, the city of Reykjavik

00:04:19.297 --> 00:04:22.633
and then the National
Government of Iceland

00:04:22.675 --> 00:04:27.054
started offering 36 and 35-hour weeks,

00:04:27.096 --> 00:04:30.808
eventually enrolling
more than 2,500 employees.